The Velodrome is a high speed cycling track reserved for people that know what they're doing.... and me. 
I take on Olympic Cyclist Ellesse Andrews and maybe teach her a thing or two...

{Made in New Zealand with the help of RNZ}

How fast can I scramble up a 15 metre high wall? 
I take on Olympic Speed Climber, Sarah Tetzlaff, in on one-on-one speed climbing duel...

